'''Ramero''' is an [[NPC]] located in the {{zone|Murder House}} towards the end of {{NPCSprite|Detective Amog}}'s first reverse-murder quest. He also appears in {{Zone|Taylor's}} and the {{Zone|Murder House}} during the second reverse-murder quest.

